# qforge: run the key-pairing agent from boot. Always on until the shell has a remote-access
# switch to start and stop it (see qforge-pairingd.service). /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh
# image so systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the stock 99-default.preset is "disable *";
# this higher-priority preset (60 < 99) keeps it enabled. A build-time multi-user.target.wants
# symlink ships alongside as a fallback (cf. 60-qforge-powerd.preset).
enable qforge-pairingd.service
